    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_rockbreakout",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Without a command from Kal'tsit, it zips towards the enemy, although a cluster of Originium rises from the ground, fully encasing the monster within."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Kal'tsit! Watch out\u2014",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really have surprised me, AMa-10.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've broken free of my control at the price of severing your own gemini cycle system, even if this makes your life now utterly fragile.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, do you really intend to kill me via this method?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew from a long time ago your consciousness was already assimilated into the information within Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_humanchange",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
