    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Under these circumstances, it is impossible to truly kill you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what Theresa and Theresis accomplished convinced me of something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your control over Originium is not absolute, and there still exist some methods to limit your authority over it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I did meet the two you speak of, within the Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "Their efforts were indeed unexpected, and a pleasantly surprising struggle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But what of it? How are you so sure now that killing me here won't be a futile act?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Mon3tr attacked you, you chose to defend yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "How did you do it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see you have noticed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on Theresa's research into Originium as well as the trap you set for Dr. {@nickname}, I added a few plans to your awakening room.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as you wake up here, your consciousness will be trapped in this body, unable to return to Originium's sea of information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you will eventually manage to break through this restriction, and regain control over Originium, but right now you are merely human.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "To think you'd go this far to rebel against me\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Priestess, you are not Terra's creator. The life on this land has no obligation to bend to your will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...This is my revenge on you, and my final act of resistance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "You see the woman standing across from you reveal a hint of hesitation, but immediately after, Originium surrounds her."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 90,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
