    {
        "text": "Black Arts crash and smash the Originium cluster, freeing Mon3tr as it quickly resumes its attack."
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium crystals begin to grow again, but it's too late to form a barrier strong enough to resist Mon3tr's claws."
    },
    {
        "text": "You see a nervous look on Priestess's face, a show of fear from the creator towards her creation."
