    {
        "text": "Am I just imagining it, or are our enemies spawning slower now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1730_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is PRTS's core system. The whole time it's been copying data of enemies we've faced in the past and pasting them here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raidian"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now it's reading the data so slowly, like something's hindering it...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raidian"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems like whatever the Doctor and the rest are doing is taking effect.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Raidian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's seize this chance and smash it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to reach the Abyss's depths... there are people waiting for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
