    {
        "text": "Black Arts and lasers take turns shooting at the gigantic and complex crystal cluster. The fierce assault even manages to suppress the Originium from spreading further."
    },
    {
        "text": "Until the light of Arts swallow Priestess's figure."
    },
    {
