    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't feel... any signs of life, or any emotions...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything happens so suddenly you haven't had the time to regard the series of events as reality."
    },
    {
        "text": "You saw that fearsome foe reduced to ashes right before your eyes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet you feel no relief at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Are we quite finished playing yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
