        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor, Amiya, fall back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A powerful show of resistance, AMa-10. Your plan has proven effective.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "As you say, there is indeed a chance for you to kill me now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But how does a single substitute made of Originium fluster you so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_003_kalts_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1718_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "AMa-10, I have no intention of debating the value of your beliefs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "The principles you have always insisted on are so insignificant I can't even find a credible logical framework to assess their significance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is not uncommon for experiments to turn out like this\u2014small errors ultimately growing into huge obstacles. I have no choice but to accept this result.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm very sorry, but I must treat you as an error, and wipe you out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Priestess"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
