    {
        "text": "Originium begins to grow once more. Thorned crystal branches tightly envelop you and Amiya in a second, nearly swallowing you both."
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya tries her best to shatter the surrounding Originium with her Arts, but the crystal clusters only grow faster."
