    {
        "text": "It all happens in a flash of light."
    },
    {
        "text": "You see the Originium crystal cluster near you explode. Amiya wanted to protect you, but time does not allow for her reaction."
    },
    {
        "text": "You see the black monster rush over, blocking you both from the cluster with its large, solid body."
    },
    {
        "text": "You see Kal'tsit..."
