    {
        "text": "Doctor, do you ever doubt the meaning in your own existence? I do."
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand my mission clearly. It is difficult, but I recognize its meaning."
    },
    {
        "text": "As for the future, I believe you will find an answer. I can only persevere in that belief."
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't spare too much worry for me. Rhodes Island shouldn't be so fragile that one person's departure would leave it unable to proceed on."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My hope?"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is to protect yours and Amiya's hopes."
    },
    {
        "text": "Though our definitions of 'protect' have nothing in common, it's an oath I will never abandon. I will be standing here with you, until the very end."
    },
    {
        "text": "We are unable to forget the past, but a different future may await you."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
