    {
        "text": "It all happens so quick, but you still manage to comprehend the cruel truth."
    },
    {
        "text": "The foe you all face is incomprehensible by conventional means. She has authority over all Originium."
    },
    {
        "text": "The bit of Originium on Kal'tsit's right shoulder is proof that she was born human, but also what steals her life away."
    },
    {
        "text": "Originium crystals begin to spread as they swallow her entire body, only to shatter as the wind blows them away\u2014your eyes fail to capture the entire process."
    },
    {
        "text": "With strength, comes fragility."
    },
    {
        "text": "A long life ends here."
    },
    {
        "text": "She has kept her promise."
    },
